msgstr "Libunga tango ya kokɔtisa OpenCV2 ."

#: src/onboarding.py:371 src/onboarding.py:564
msgid "Try reinstalling cv2"
msgstr "Meka kozongisa cv2 ."

#: src/onboarding.py:382
msgid "No webcams found on system"
msgstr "Webcams ezwami te na système"

#: src/onboarding.py:382
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible camera is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Svp configurer camera na yo yo moko soki ozali sûr que caméra compatible "
"ezali connecté"

#: src/onboarding.py:455
msgid "No, camera can't be opened"
msgstr "Te, camera ekoki kofungwama te"

#: src/onboarding.py:467
msgid "No, not an infrared camera"
msgstr "Te, kamera ya infrarouge te"

#: src/onboarding.py:471
msgid "Yes, compatible infrared camera"
msgstr "Oui, caméra infrarouge compatible"

#: src/onboarding.py:488
msgid "Camera identifier or path"
msgstr "Identifiant ya kamera to nzela"

#: src/onboarding.py:488
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Kolendisa"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Error selecting camera"
msgstr "Libunga na kopona kamera"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Caméra oyo oponi ekoki kofungwama te"

#: src/onboarding.py:582
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Meká kopona mosusu"

#: src/onboarding.py:597
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Tosɛngi bino bókende kotala\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"mpo na ko activer émetteur na yo ya ir"

#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Bobongisi ya mwinda 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Bobongisi ya mwinda 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ekoki ko sauver modèle ya elongi te"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan modèle ya mibale"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ekokaki ko enregistrer modèle ya mibale te"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Modèle na yo ya liboso ebombami, yango wana login ya elongi esalaka déjà. "
"Chambre esengeli kaka ezala kongenga mpo na komona elongi na yo — bongola "
"mwinda na esika ya kokanga yango — sima meka lisusu, to sauter mpe bakisa "
"modèle moko sima uta na Paramètres."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Skani ya míbalé: talatala, mandɛfu to mwínda ekeseni"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Modɛlɛ ya libosó ebombami: kokɔta na elongi esili kosála. Modɛlɛ ya míbalé "
"ekómisaka koyeba ya kotyela motema ntángo elóko ebongwani: látá talatala oyo "
"olátaka mbala mosúsu (to longolá yangó), kangá yangó na mandɛfu ekeseni, mpe "
"bongolá mwínda — pelisá to bomá mwínda, longwá pene ya lininísa. Tíká elongi "
"na yo emonana polele mpe finá Skani lisusu; bokangi mokusé ya kotambwisama "
"ndenge moko ekolanda."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Kotala matériel mpe bisaleli ya TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami. Kotia <i>tpm2-tools</i> na "
"ndenge ya automatique..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel TPM 2.0 ezali kosala. Mot de passe na yo "
"ekokangama malamu na kati ya TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki kofungola {} na yo yango moko na nzela ya bondimi ya "
"elongi (portefeuille emonani: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Bisaleli ya TPM emonani, kasi kotia <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"yango moko elongi te. Salá <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Tozongi "
"na kobomba ba mot de passe na nzela ya logiciel."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami te. Kosalela caching ya ba "
"credentiels oyo esalemi na logiciel (AES-256-GCM)."

