#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ba snapshots ya elongi na yo oyo Ubuntu Hello ekokanisi contre. Bomba ata "
"mibale, oyo ekomami na pole ekeseni."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Kolakisa ba modèles oyo ebombami mpo na:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Modɛlɛ mɔ̌kɔ́ ya elongi kaka nde ekomisami. Talatala, mbongwana ya mandɛfu to "
"mwínda ekeseni ebongolaka ndenge kamera emonaka elongi na yo, yangó wana "
"modɛlɛ mɔ̌kɔ́ ekoki kolónga te (na ndakisa na mpokwa na nsé ya mínda). Bakisá "
"modɛlɛ ya míbalé na talatala to kozánga yangó, na lolenge na yo mosúsu, to "
"na mwínda ekeseni mpo ete kofungola etíkala ya kotyela motema."

#: src/main.ui:146
