#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Notification ya bureau elakisaka tango Ubuntu Hello azali koluka elongi na "
"yo, sima ezo lakisa résultat. Ba tentatives oyo elongi te etikalaka na liste "
"ya notification."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Lakisa mayebisi"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Carte moko na tentative moko ya authentification ya elongi, mise à jour na "
"esika na résultat."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Notification ezo yokana"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Beta son ya système mpo na komeka oyo eyebani to oyo elongi te."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Salá mpe ba diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Bakisa modèle, certitude vs seuil, cadres, caméra na timing na carte moko na "
"moko. Ezali na ntina ntango ozali koyebisa mokakatano moko."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Libateli"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Ndenge elongi na yo esengeli kokokana, mpe soki Ubuntu Hello asengi yo "
"kondima ete ozali mpenza awa."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Bokasi ya bokokani ya elongi"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Noki"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Ezali na bokatikati"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Libateli"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Sengá ngai naningisa motó mpo na kondima"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Sima elongi na yo ekokani, notification moko ekosenga yo koningisa motó. "
"Foto oyo batelemisi liboso ya kamera ekoki koningisa motó te."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Clé / KWallet Déverrouillage automatique"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Pelisá bondimi ya elongi mpo na kofungola yango moko keyring ya bokɔti na yo "
"to KWallet na ntango ya bokɔti. Yango ebombaka mot de passe na yo na "
"libateli, ekangami na kati ya TPM soki ezali, to ebombami na AES-256-GCM na "
"fungola ya monene oyo kaka root akoki kosalela. Bondimi ya elongi etiaka "
"PAM_AUTHTOK mpo na pam_gnome_keyring to pam_kwallet5, engebene na bureau na "
"yo."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Ezalela ya lelo:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Ko vérifier..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Activer Auto-Déverrouillage"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Keyring ya ba clés"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Monɔkɔ ya efanímí"

